{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer",
  "version": "0.4.1",
  "description": "DSH 提示词优化插件：输入框工具行 ✦ 一键读取草稿、结构化改写、回填并可还原；v0.2 起支持多模型 API 管理与守恒校验；v0.3 起密钥可选、endpoint 允许 query、引擎默认 auto；v0.3.1 修「添加模型/切引擎点了没反应」；v0.4 重写系统提示词（正向质量目标 + 四道自检 + few-shot + 类型分流）并把守恒口径改为硬 Token + 软覆盖率两层；v0.4.1 软守恒加反义极性层（同轴正反词被对调时判不保真）并修掉构建期端点自检误伤",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "prompt"
  ],
  "author": "iiaww5816-sys",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/iiaww5816-sys/dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/iiaww5816-sys/dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/iiaww5816-sys/dsh-plugin-prompt-optimizer/issues"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": true
}
